     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": null,
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身",
      "en": "Origins"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1883年7月29日生於福爾利省普雷達皮奧的多維亞村，是鐵匠亞歷山德羅與小學教師羅莎·馬爾托尼的長子。",
      "en": "Born on 29 July 1883 at Dovia, a hamlet of Predappio (Forlì), the eldest son of Alessandro, a blacksmith, and Rosa Maltoni, an elementary-school teacher."
     },
     "relatedRecordIds": [],
     "citations": [
