      "end": "1914-11-16"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": null,
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "記者與政治轉向",
      "en": "Journalism and political turn"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "他曾獲任命為《前進報》（Avanti!）主編。1914年11月15日，他創辦並主持的《意大利人民報》（Il Popolo d'Italia）出刊。",
      "en": "He was appointed editor of Avanti!; on 15 November 1914 Il Popolo d'Italia, which he founded and directed, appeared."
     },
