      "start": "1922-10-29",
      "end": "1922-11-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "上台",
      "en": "Coming to power"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1922年10月29日墨索里尼以電報獲命組閣，並自兼內政部與外交部。Treccani 稱，這是歐洲議會制國家第一次把政府交給武裝政黨的領袖。",
      "en": "On 29 October 1922 Mussolini was telegrammed the task of forming a government and kept the Interior and Foreign ministries himself. Treccani notes it was the first time in European parliamentary states that government passed to the head of an armed party."
     },
     "relatedRecordIds": [
      "01a19eb7-b070-7bd6-9122-7f7eb2606029"
     ],
