    {
     "ord": 4,
     "period": {
      "start": "1925-01-03",
      "end": "1930-01-01"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "day",
     "periodEndPrecision": "year",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "獨裁與教廷和解",
      "en": "Dictatorship and the Lateran Pacts"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1925年1月3日他在眾議院演說，承擔法西斯所作所為的全部責任，並展開明確的獨裁政策；1929年簽署《拉特朗條約》，結束羅馬問題。",
      "en": "On 3 January 1925, in a speech to the Chamber, he took full responsibility for everything Fascism had done and launched a decidedly dictatorial policy; in 1929 he signed the Lateran Pacts, ending the Roman Question."
     },
     "relatedRecordIds": [
      "01a19eb7-b070-7bd6-9122-7f7eb2606029"
