    {
     "ord": 5,
     "period": {
      "start": "1935-01-01",
      "end": "1945-04-29"
     },
     "periodStartPrecision": "year",
     "periodEndPrecision": "day",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "戰爭與終局",
      "en": "War and end"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1935年入侵衣索比亞是轉折點；1940年6月10日他把意大利拖入戰爭。1943年7月25日後政權崩潰，他被國王免職、逮捕，隨後被德軍救出並帶往德國，再出任義大利社會共和國（RSI）首腦。1945年4月27日被游擊隊俘獲，次日遭槍決。",
      "en": "The 1935 aggression against Ethiopia was the turning point; on 10 June 1940 he dragged Italy into the war. After 25 July 1943 the regime collapsed; the king dismissed and arrested him, the Germans freed him and took him to Germany, and he then headed the Italian Social Republic (RSI). Partisans captured him on 27 April 1945 and he was shot the next day."
     },
