     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "美國國會圖書館的尼泊爾概況把特里布萬的在位期標為1911至1955年。最後一位拉納寡頭統治者莫漢·舒姆舍爾同意讓國王恢復權力並舉行選舉，1951年2月特里布萬重掌權力。",
      "en": "The Library of Congress country profile gives Tribhuvan's reign as 1911–55. The last Rana oligarch, Mohan Shamsher, agreed to restore the king to power and hold elections, and in February 1951 Tribhuvan returned to power."
