      "en": "Early life and Victorian politics"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1856年8月3日生於維多利亞州墨爾本。就讀墨爾本文法學校，後於墨爾本大學讀法律；1879年當選維多利亞州西布爾克選區議員。",
      "en": "Born 3 August 1856 in Melbourne, Victoria. He attended Melbourne Grammar School, later studied law at the University of Melbourne, and in 1879 won the Victorian state seat of West Bourke."
     },
