      "en": "Victorian minister and Attorney-General"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1883至1890年間他擔任多個部長職位，其中一段時間為總理（Premier）。聯邦成立後，他在巴頓政府擔任總檢察長，並接任巴頓成為總理。",
      "en": "Between 1883 and 1890 he held several ministerial portfolios, including a period as Premier. In the Barton government he was Attorney-General, and he succeeded Barton as prime minister."
