     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "出身與教育",
      "en": "Origins and education"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1868年3月26日生於吉薩，為前總督伊斯瑪儀帕夏的么子。父親1879年被廢黜後隨家人流亡意大利，福阿德在那裡長大受教育。",
      "en": "Born 26 March 1868 in Giza, the youngest son of Khedive Ismail Pasha. After Ismail's deposition in 1879 the family went into exile in Italy, where Fuad was brought up and educated."
     },
