     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "蘇丹與獨立",
      "en": "Sultan and independence"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "1917年他即位為蘇丹。英國被迫在1922年給予埃及名義上的獨立，為1923年4月19日以敕令頒布的憲法，以及福阿德登上埃及王位鋪了路。",
      "en": "In 1917 he assumed power as sultan. The British were compelled to grant Egypt nominal independence in 1922, which paved the way for a constitution promulgated by royal decree on 19 April 1923 and for Fuad's accession as king of Egypt."
     },
