     "periodStartPrecision": "year",
     "periodEndPrecision": "year",
     "heading": {
      "zh-Hant": "國王與議會",
      "en": "King and Parliament"
     },
     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "憲法雖使埃及在理論上成為君主立憲，卻賦予國王很大權力：他可以提出立法、召集並解散議會。1930年由華夫脫黨主導的議會被解散，第一部憲法被廢除並由另一部取代；1934年改回1923年憲法。",
      "en": "Although Egypt theoretically became a constitutional monarchy, the constitution gave the king considerable powers: he could initiate legislation and convene and dissolve Parliament. In 1930 the Wafd-dominated Parliament was dissolved and the first constitution was abolished and replaced by another; in 1934 the 1923 constitution was restored."
     },
     "relatedRecordIds": [
      "01a1aa4a-7e36-7c61-a6fd-0422999211d3"
