     "body": {
      "zh-Hant": "Gale 條目稱他為1915年3至7月間的海地總統。任內混亂與暴力不斷，他忙於對付以羅薩爾沃·博博為首的政敵，下令處決167名囚犯，其中多為博博的支持者。7月28日他在太子港被暴民處死，美軍隨即占領海地。",
      "en": "Gale's entry describes him as president of Haiti from March to July 1915. His presidency was marked by mounting chaos and violence; he fought his political enemies led by Rosalvo Bobo and ordered the execution of 167 prisoners, many of them Bobo's supporters. On 28 July 1915 he was lynched by a mob in Port-au-Prince, and U.S. Marines occupied Haiti shortly after."
     },
